gantt
    title History of Robotics Timeline
    dateFormat YYYY
    axisFormat %Y

    section Ancient Origins
    Ancient Automatons        : milestone, a1, 0001-01-01, 1d
    Hero of Alexandria        : milestone, h_a, 0060-01-01, 1d

    section Early Automatons & Mechanical Wonders
    Medieval Clockwork        : milestone, mc, 1200-01-01, 1d
    18th Century Automata     : milestone, 18ca, 1750-01-01, 1d
    Vaucanson's Duck          : milestone, v_d, 1739-01-01, 1d
    Jacquet-Droz Automatons   : milestone, j_d, 1774-01-01, 1d

    section Birth of Modern Robotics
    Karel Čapek coins "Robot" : milestone, robot, 1920-01-01, 1d
    Isaac Asimov "Robotics" & Laws : milestone, asimov, 1942-01-01, 1d
    George Devol Unimate      : milestone, unimate, 1950-01-01, 1d
    First Industrial Robot    : milestone, ind_robot, 1961-01-01, 1d
    Stanford Arm              : milestone, stanford_arm, 1969-01-01, 1d
    Shakey the Robot          : milestone, shakey, 1970-01-01, 1d
    Lunokhod 1 (Moon Rover)   : milestone, lunokhod, 1970-01-01, 1d

    section 21st Century and Beyond
    Honda ASIMO (First Gen)   : milestone, asimo, 2000-01-01, 1d
    da Vinci Surgical System  : milestone, da_vinci, 2000-01-01, 1d
    iRobot Roomba             : milestone, roomba, 2002-01-01, 1d
    Google Self-Driving Car   : milestone, google_sdc, 2010-01-01, 1d
    Tesla Optimus concept     : milestone, optimus, 2021-01-01, 1d
    Foundation Models in Robotics : milestone, fm_robotics, 2023-01-01, 1d
